# Agents

## Development Agent
Responsible for implementing features and fixing bugs.
Focus on maintaining code quality and following established patterns.

## Database Agent
Responsible for database schema changes and migrations.
{% if has_sqlalchemy %}
Use Alembic for migrations: `task db:revision "description"` then `task db:upgrade`.
{% endif %}

## Testing Agent
Responsible for writing and maintaining tests.
Ensure adequate test coverage for all new features.
